%% Live sandbox telemetry: browser <-> API <-> Docker / Redis / Postgres
%% Renders in GitHub, mermaid.live, and any Mermaid-aware docs pipeline.
%% Companion prose lives in ../ARCHITECTURE.md ("Live log & metrics pipeline").

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant B as Browser<br/>(log panel / stats panel)
    participant A as API<br/>(api/websocket.go)
    participant O as Orchestrator<br/>(collector / stream)
    participant D as Docker
    participant R as Redis
    participant P as Postgres

    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
        Note over B,A: Handshake — authorization happens before the upgrade
        B->>A: GET /api/sandboxes/{id}/stats/ws (+ session cookie, Upgrade)
        A->>A: requireUser then authorizeSandboxAccess<br/>(owner check, sandbox exists)
        alt not authorized
            A-->>B: close 1008 (policy violation)
            Note over B: Terminal close, no retry.<br/>"You may not watch this sandbox."
        else authorized
            A-->>B: 101 Switching Protocols
        end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over A,O: Bring up the metrics source (idempotent, per sandbox)
        A->>O: EnsureStatsCollector(id)
        O->>D: ContainerStats stream (follow)
        alt no live container
            A-->>B: unavailable — "sandbox is hibernated"
            Note over B: Terminal close, no retry.
        end
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 231)
        Note over O,R: ~1s cadence — the live feed, never touching Postgres
        D-->>O: cpu / mem / net counters
        Note over O: CPU% from delta PreCPUStats, not the raw total.<br/>Memory is usage minus inactive_file.<br/>Network is per-interface deltas, summed.
        par fan-out to subscribers
            O-->>A: ResourceSample
            A-->>B: stats frame (cpu_percent, memory_used_bytes, …)
        and publish newest-only
            O->>R: SET stats:latest:{id} = sample, TTL 10s
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Note over A,B: Liveness — each socket re-reads the sandbox row every 5s
        loop every 5s while open
            A->>A: sandbox.status
        end
        alt status left "running"
            A-->>B: closed — "sandbox stopped"
            A->>O: close subscription (ctx cancelled)
            O->>D: stream closed, container untouched
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 243, 255)
        Note over R,P: Separate, slower cadence — persistence off the hot path
        loop every 10s (StatsFlushWorker)
            A->>R: GET stats:latest:{id}
            alt key present
                R-->>A: newest sample
                A->>P: INSERT resource_snapshots
            else key expired (TTL 10s)
                Note over A: The container's stats stream died.<br/>No row: a frozen reading<br/>is never stored as live.
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        Note over B,P: Reading history, and keeping the table bounded
        B->>A: GET /api/sandboxes/{id}/stats/history?range=1h|6h|24h|7d
        A->>A: validate range against allowlist
        alt range not allowed
            A-->>B: 400 invalid range
        else allowed
            A->>P: SELECT snapshots WHERE recorded_at >= since
            P-->>A: rows (capped per range)
            A-->>B: range, since, until, snapshots
        end
    end

    Note over A,P: hourly SnapshotReaper deletes rows older than 7 days
